00:22:29.410 --> 00:22:31.420
whether one on one, you
in an audience like this,

00:22:31.420 --> 00:22:33.600
or the whole fucking
world when I do content.

00:22:33.600 --> 00:22:35.710
I talk so much strategically to get

00:22:35.710 --> 00:22:38.480
reaction so I can listen
so I can readjust.

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:39.690
You know its fun when I talk to

00:22:39.690 --> 00:22:42.249
