because I didn't realize this

00:22:43.082 --> 00:22:44.420
because I didn't know anything about it

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:46.103
like I'm all reactionary.

00:22:47.160 --> 00:22:49.363
I'm all that, I'm a counter-puncher.

00:22:50.844 --> 00:22:53.280
I'm doing things to force you into a move

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:54.880
so I can then do the next move.

00:22:54.880 --> 00:22:56.130
It's chess.

00:22:56.130 --> 00:22:58.350
I just do it with communication.

00:22:58.350 --> 00:23:01.370
I even think that my
personality in hindsight

00:23:01.370 --> 00:23:03.960
has developed into this
caricature of who I am

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:06.050
to create the natural reaction

00:23:06.050 --> 00:23:08.040
because I'm able to
judge people very quickly

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:09.850
based on how they react to me.

00:23:09.850 --> 00:23:12.090
- At what point do you

00:23:12.090 --> 00:23:13.564
what do you hold on to?

00:23:13.564 --> 00:23:15.750
You know, you're giving away great stuff

00:23:15.750 --> 00:23:18.864
so I understand every time they hear you

00:23:18.864 --> 00:23:22.660
they almost sound like oh I
get to make a little more.

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:23.580
But what do you hold on to?

00:23:23.580 --> 00:23:24.870
- So here's what's interesting about me

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:25.703
that's a little different

00:23:25.703 --> 00:23:26.880
I don't know if you
guys have paid attention

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:29.220
I have not set out to monetize my audience

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:32.300
like the majority of people
which I'm empathetic, I get it.

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:34.100
What makes me a little
tough to use as a proxy

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:35.470
is that I've always made my money

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:36.580
in a separate business

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:39.120
than my audience buying stuff from me.

00:23:39.120 --> 00:23:41.150
Super easy to give
everything away for free

00:23:41.150 --> 00:23:43.353
when you're not counting
on any of the money.

00:23:44.320 --> 00:23:45.153
Right?

00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:48.290
Here's the mistake everybody makes.

00:23:48.290 --> 00:23:50.530
Everybody thinks you give
away some lightweight shit,

00:23:50.530 --> 00:23:51.947
and you sell your best stuff.

00:23:51.947 --> 00:23:54.300
That's what everybody does.

00:23:54.300 --> 00:23:56.110
I think it's the other way around,

00:23:56.110 --> 00:23:57.690
I give away all my best shit.

00:23:57.690 --> 00:23:58.920
If I was selling my audience

00:23:58.920 --> 00:24:00.807
I would give away all my best shit,

00:24:00.807 --> 00:24:03.323
and then what I would sell is access.

00:24:05.150 --> 00:24:07.290
Unscalable stuff.

00:24:07.290 --> 00:24:08.920
Because if you're giving away bullshit

00:24:08.920 --> 00:24:10.830
or just stuff that's just not that strong,

00:24:10.830 --> 00:24:12.170
you're never gonna get them into the

00:24:12.170 --> 00:24:13.920
interest graph to begin with.

00:24:13.920 --> 00:24:15.450
The other thing is way
too many people think

00:24:15.450 --> 00:24:18.280
they're sitting on something
that means something.

00:24:18.280 --> 00:24:19.943
Information is commoditized.

00:24:21.940 --> 00:24:23.090
People want to sell information,

00:24:23.090 --> 00:24:24.430
I make fun of all my friends who think

00:24:24.430 --> 00:24:26.240
they're going to make a 97 dollar ebook.

00:24:26.240 --> 00:24:27.700
I'm like bro.

00:24:27.700 --> 00:24:30.250
I'm like cool, but do you feel good about

00:24:30.250 --> 00:24:32.660
selling somebody 97 dollars worth of shit

00:24:32.660 --> 00:24:35.010
that you just control
copied from the internet?

00:24:36.400 --> 00:24:41.161
So I think you hold onto
something that is not scalable.

00:24:41.161 --> 00:24:44.010
So I think access is not scalable.

00:24:44.010 --> 00:24:45.910
Your time is not scalable.

00:24:45.910 --> 00:24:49.010
I think the best model
is to sell something

00:24:49.010 --> 00:24:50.270
that is not scalable,

00:24:50.270 --> 00:24:53.650
that's hard for you as
the individual to scale.

00:24:53.650 --> 00:24:55.400
But then you can maximize it right?

00:24:56.970 --> 00:24:58.440
I mean the amount of money people offer me

00:24:58.440 --> 00:25:00.430
to spend an hour with me.

00:25:00.430 --> 00:25:02.413
The emails I get are so crazy.

00:25:03.757 --> 00:25:06.860
I had some guy send me 100
thousand dollars in my Paypal.

00:25:06.860 --> 00:25:08.517
Just like sent it, and he's like one hour.

00:25:08.517 --> 00:25:10.590
And I couldn't take it, I
just gave it to him for free.

00:25:10.590 --> 00:25:12.380
But like what it told me was fuck

00:25:12.380 --> 00:25:15.170
this is so right, this is so right.

00:25:15.170 --> 00:25:17.310
So for all the people
that are trying to sell

00:25:17.310 --> 00:25:18.381
and do all these things,

00:25:18.381 --> 00:25:20.540
you know like doing the right thing

00:25:20.540 --> 00:25:21.660
is always the right thing.

00:25:21.660 --> 00:25:23.120
So what do you hold on to?

00:25:23.120 --> 00:25:24.800
Something that isn't scalable.

00:25:24.800 --> 00:25:25.890
What do you give away?

00:25:25.890 --> 00:25:27.243
The best shit you got.

00:25:29.502 --> 00:25:32.585
(muffled speaking)

00:25:32.585 --> 00:25:33.418
- [Man In White Shirt] I
know you've done hundreds

00:25:33.418 --> 00:25:35.910
