00:25:40.560 --> 00:25:43.570
so they'll hear bits and pieces--

00:25:43.570 --> 00:25:46.060
- The notion of the curated content

00:25:46.060 --> 00:25:49.150
as a packaged product is a fair debate

00:25:49.150 --> 00:25:50.700
'cause time is valuable

00:25:50.700 --> 00:25:52.330
and so for the people
who are really stuck,

00:25:52.330 --> 00:25:53.960
who don't want to sell their time

00:25:53.960 --> 00:25:55.310
or don't want to go with my model,

00:25:55.310 --> 00:25:58.270
I think the one thing that
is a worthwhile debate

00:25:58.270 --> 00:26:00.370
is if you curate all your stuff in one.

00:26:00.370 --> 00:26:02.250
It's kind of how I think of a book right.

00:26:02.250 --> 00:26:05.900
Like here's for 13 bucks
all the last year and a half

00:26:05.900 --> 00:26:06.733
in one place.

00:26:06.733 --> 00:26:09.900
So you know listen, I'm not god

00:26:11.060 --> 00:26:13.090
here's my number one piece of advice,

00:26:13.090 --> 00:26:16.470
if you feel great about what you sell,

00:26:16.470 --> 00:26:19.010
sell whatever the fuck you want, right?

00:26:19.010 --> 00:26:20.790
But make sure you're not feeling great

00:26:20.790 --> 00:26:22.060
because of the selfish needs

00:26:22.060 --> 00:26:24.190
for the financial impact on your life.

00:26:24.190 --> 00:26:25.023
Make sure you feel great,

00:26:25.023 --> 00:26:26.370
because you've looked at everything else

00:26:26.370 --> 00:26:27.600
that they could spend their money on

00:26:27.600 --> 00:26:28.923
and will it really work.

00:26:31.778 --> 00:26:35.067
